### AI Knowledge Base - base vars
# 说明:
# 1. 路径按 `AiKnowledgeApi` 的 Feign 定义组织，默认带 `/aiEngine` 前缀。
# 2. upsert 走本地知识库文档管理接口，会在本地保存文档与版本后同步到 Provider。
# 3. `workspaceId` / `kbId` 可直接在 ext/meta.ext 中覆盖，便于本地切换百炼业务空间或指定知识库。

@apiPrefix = /aiEngine
@contentType = application/json;charset=UTF-8
@acceptJson = application/json

@workspaceId = ws-zi3sfdp4xf4wsb6v
@kbId = w05enpcxa4
@traceId = local-http-kb-001
@scene = manual-http-test
@docId1 = file_0661cff9804e40dbb2808dc41524957c_16686760
@topK = 5
@kbCode = {{kbId}}
@documentCode = {{docId1}}
@documentDbId = 1

### 1) Upsert local knowledge document
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/internal/v1/ai/kb/document/upsert
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbId": "{{kbId}}",
  "documentId": "{{docId1}}",
  "documentName": "manual-http-test/profile-001.txt",
  "documentType": 1,
  "sourceKey": "manual-http-test",
  "content": "张三，男，28岁，来自上海，当前职位是高级数据分析师，擅长 Java、SQL 和 Python。",
  "canUpdate": true,
  "ext": {
    "traceId": "{{traceId}}",
    "scene": "{{scene}}",
    "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}",
    "categoryId": "default",
    "parser": "DASHSCOPE_DOCMIND",
    "bizType": "employee-profile",
    "owner": "codex"
  }
}

### 2) Search knowledge base
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/execution/kb/search
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}

{
  "kbId": "{{kbId}}",
  "query": "谁擅长 boot 框架？",
  "topK": {{topK}},
  "meta": {
    "traceId": "{{traceId}}-search",
    "scene": "{{scene}}",
    "ext": {
      "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}"
    }
  }
}

### 3) Delete documents
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/execution/kb/delete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}

{
  "kbId": "{{kbId}}",
  "documentIds": [
    "{{docId1}}"
  ],
  "meta": {
    "traceId": "{{traceId}}-delete",
    "scene": "{{scene}}",
    "ext": {
      "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}"
    }
  }
}

### 4) get document detail
GET {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/detail?documentCode={{docId1}}&kbCode={{kbId}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) page api - knowledge base list
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/list
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 6) page api - create knowledge base
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/create
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbCode": "{{kbCode}}",
  "kbName": "manual-http-test-kb",
  "bizType": 1,
  "sourceKey": "manual-http-test",
  "providerKbId": "{{kbId}}",
  "status": 1,
  "ext": {
    "traceId": "{{traceId}}-page-create",
    "scene": "{{scene}}",
    "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}",
    "owner": "codex"
  }
}

### 7) page api - document list
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/list
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbCode": "{{kbCode}}",
  "keyword": "{{documentCode}}",
  "tab": "current",
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20
}

### 8) page api - document detail
GET {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/detail?kbCode={{kbCode}}&documentCode={{documentCode}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) page api - document upsert
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/upsert
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbId": "{{kbCode}}",
  "documentId": "{{documentCode}}",
  "documentName": "manual-http-test/profile-001.txt",
  "documentType": 1,
  "bizType": 1,
  "sourceKey": "manual-http-test",
  "content": "张三，男，28岁，来自上海，当前职位是高级数据分析师，擅长 Java、SQL 和 Python。",
  "canUpdate": true,
  "ext": {
    "traceId": "{{traceId}}-page-upsert",
    "scene": "{{scene}}",
    "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}",
    "owner": "codex"
  }
}

### 10) page api - update document content
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/content/update
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "documentId": {{documentDbId}},
  "content": "张三，男，28岁，来自上海，当前职位是高级数据分析师，擅长 Java、SQL、Python 和 Spring Boot。",
  "ext": {
    "traceId": "{{traceId}}-page-content-update",
    "scene": "{{scene}}",
    "workspaceId": "{{workspaceId}}"
  }
}

### 11) page api - sync document
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbCode": "{{kbCode}}",
  "documentCodes": [
    "{{documentCode}}"
  ],
  "force": true
}

### 12) page api - check document sync
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/sync/check
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbCode": "{{kbCode}}",
  "documentCodes": [
    "{{documentCode}}"
  ]
}

### 13) page api - delete document
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/ai/kb/document/delete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kbCode": "{{kbCode}}",
  "documentCodes": [
    "{{documentCode}}"
  ]
}
